      "local_reason_code": "local_unified_runtime_inventory_planned",
      "local_deviation": "Local Desktop should project the supervised sidecar and local sandboxes instead of inventing Cloud pool resources.",
      "judgment_rationale": "Unified Runtimes combines global Cloud pool status and instances with tenant-scoped project sandboxes in one tenant route. The pool requests ignore the route tenant, expose records for multiple tenants, and the pool router enforces neither authentication nor global administration; only the sandbox half has tenant membership authority. Desktop currently exposes connection settings and runtime telemetry fragments, not this routed inventory; a single-machine sidecar projection remains meaningful and is planned."
