      "local_deviation": "A single supervised Local sidecar is not a multi-tenant resource pool. The native page must return this stable cloud-only disposition without emulating capacity or billing controls.",
      "judgment_rationale": "PoolDashboard calls global pool status, instance list, pause, resume, terminate, and JSON metrics endpoints. It renders status/resource summaries and current-page filters, while the JSON metrics response is not consumed and detail, project-tier, and Prometheus service methods are not bound to the page. The router enforces neither authentication nor global administration and does not tenant-scope list or lifecycle operations, so the tenant route is degraded. No native Desktop route exists, and reproducing a Cloud resource pool in Local mode would create false authority."
